1
00:00:55,000 --> 00:00:59,000
"The Last Oath"

2
00:00:59,593 --> 00:01:04,093
(Episode 5: Infected Sensory Profile)

3
00:01:28,125 --> 00:01:29,125
Don't move.

4
00:02:01,416 --> 00:02:02,500
I can take the tape off,

5
00:02:03,250 --> 00:02:04,250
but you need to behave.

6
00:02:04,791 --> 00:02:07,031
You don't want to attract the
zombies back here, do you?

7
00:02:17,291 --> 00:02:18,375
Why did you tie me up?

8
00:02:18,708 --> 00:02:19,833
Where are you taking me?

9
00:02:20,875 --> 00:02:22,750
I told you I have
something important to do.

10
00:02:23,583 --> 00:02:25,208
What does that have to do with me?

11
00:02:27,791 --> 00:02:29,591
I've been looking for
someone very important.

12
00:02:30,583 --> 00:02:31,583
And that someone is you.

13
00:02:34,000 --> 00:02:35,625
I didn't even know you before this.

14
00:02:36,500 --> 00:02:37,500
Besides,

15
00:02:37,708 --> 00:02:40,250
is this how you treat someone important?

16
00:02:41,125 --> 00:02:43,208
I can't explain it all to you right now.

17
00:02:44,541 --> 00:02:46,392
I need to get you on the
road as soon as possible.

18
00:02:46,416 --> 00:02:48,096
This was the simplest and most direct way.

19
00:02:48,208 --> 00:02:49,333
Explain it to me right now.

20
00:02:50,125 --> 00:02:50,958
If you can't explain it clearly,

21
00:02:50,959 --> 00:02:52,625
we're staying right here.

22
00:02:57,666 --> 00:02:58,666
I'm looking for you

23
00:02:59,041 --> 00:03:00,375
because you're immune.

24
00:03:01,666 --> 00:03:04,066
You have the gene that makes
you immune to the zombie virus.

25
00:03:05,250 --> 00:03:06,333
Immune?

26
00:03:07,166 --> 00:03:08,166
Are you kidding me?

27
00:03:08,625 --> 00:03:09,625
How do you know that?

28
00:03:20,958 --> 00:03:21,833
Don't tell me

29
00:03:21,834 --> 00:03:23,958
you bit yourself just for fun.

30
00:03:31,083 --> 00:03:31,791
Guangqi.

31
00:03:31,791 --> 00:03:32,541
I'm here.

32
00:03:32,708 --> 00:03:34,625
Check if the target is immune.

33
00:03:35,875 --> 00:03:37,583
Target confirmed as immune.

34
00:03:42,041 --> 00:03:43,458
Have you never wondered

35
00:03:44,000 --> 00:03:46,120
why you didn't turn into a
zombie after being bitten?

36
00:03:49,916 --> 00:03:51,041
So you saved me

37
00:03:51,541 --> 00:03:53,333
just because I'm immune?

38
00:03:53,875 --> 00:03:55,795
Then why didn't you just
take me away back then?

39
00:03:57,875 --> 00:03:59,475
I needed to wait for your wound to heal.

40
00:04:03,375 --> 00:04:05,707
Traveling with an injured
person is too much of a burden.

41
00:04:05,708 --> 00:04:06,708
Is that so?

42
00:04:23,333 --> 00:04:24,625
You bastard.

43
00:04:26,458 --> 00:04:28,666
And to think I treated you as a
friend and trusted you so much.

44
00:04:31,125 --> 00:04:32,125
What about the others?

45
00:04:32,500 --> 00:04:33,708
What did you do to them?

46
00:04:38,000 --> 00:04:39,458
I had no reason to hurt them.

47
00:04:42,333 --> 00:04:45,041
I left a note saying we
went out to pick wild berries.

48
00:04:49,458 --> 00:04:50,750
I've said all I needed to say.

49
00:04:51,458 --> 00:04:52,458
Since you're awake,

50
00:04:53,291 --> 00:04:54,651
do yourself a favor and follow me.

51
00:04:55,464 --> 00:04:57,144
There will be a lot of danger on the road.

52
00:04:58,083 --> 00:04:59,416
Even though you're immune,

53
00:04:59,666 --> 00:05:01,866
you still wouldn't survive
being torn apart by zombies.

54
00:05:05,333 --> 00:05:07,250
Don't cause yourself unnecessary trouble.

55
00:05:15,416 --> 00:05:16,416
Untie my hands too.

56
00:05:18,083 --> 00:05:19,083
No.

57
00:05:19,541 --> 00:05:20,750
I need to use the bathroom.

58
00:05:20,916 --> 00:05:23,116
Are you seriously not going
to let go to the bathroom on this trip?

59
00:06:31,083 --> 00:06:32,083
Let go, you jerk!

60
00:06:32,583 --> 00:06:33,583
Still want to run?

61
00:06:41,750 --> 00:06:43,083
No, I'm done running.

62
00:06:47,208 --> 00:06:48,250
If there's a next time,

63
00:06:48,583 --> 00:06:49,791
I won't be so polite.

64
00:07:12,166 --> 00:07:13,166
You go first.

65
00:07:14,250 --> 00:07:15,500
What are you trying to do now?

66
00:07:16,708 --> 00:07:18,458
You tied me up just to walk me like a dog?

67
00:07:19,125 --> 00:07:20,125
Walk in front.

68
00:08:09,000 --> 00:08:10,000
Hey.

69
00:08:10,041 --> 00:08:11,500
Who exactly sent you?

70
00:08:14,125 --> 00:08:15,445
You're looking for immune people.

71
00:08:16,166 --> 00:08:17,846
Your organization must be pretty powerful.

72
00:08:18,708 --> 00:08:19,625
If they're so powerful,

73
00:08:19,626 --> 00:08:21,546
why didn't they send a
helicopter to pick us up?

74
00:08:21,958 --> 00:08:23,998
If you don't want to walk,
I can keep carrying you.

75
00:08:24,375 --> 00:08:25,707
But I'll have to tape your mouth shut

76
00:08:25,708 --> 00:08:27,068
so you don't throw up all over me.

77
00:08:28,416 --> 00:08:29,416
You!

78
00:08:29,583 --> 00:08:31,743
Don't tell me you lost
contact with your organization.

79
00:08:37,208 --> 00:08:38,750
How much longer do we have to walk?

80
00:08:39,250 --> 00:08:40,650
We can't just keep walking forever.

81
00:08:41,000 --> 00:08:43,080
Even in Journey to the
West, they had a white horse.

82
00:08:43,666 --> 00:08:45,306
We need to cross Qianlong Mountain first.

83
00:08:45,500 --> 00:08:46,625
My car is parked up ahead.

84
00:08:48,875 --> 00:08:49,375
So,

85
00:08:49,375 --> 00:08:50,375
who exactly are you?

86
00:08:50,833 --> 00:08:51,833
A mercenary?

87
00:08:52,166 --> 00:08:53,166
A bounty hunter?

88
00:08:53,250 --> 00:08:54,250
Or something else?

89
00:08:58,000 --> 00:08:59,200
Who exactly is looking for me?

90
00:09:00,208 --> 00:09:02,416
I at least have the right
to know that, don't I?

91
00:09:03,708 --> 00:09:05,541
You'll find out when we get there.

92
00:09:07,250 --> 00:09:07,416
Tch.

93
00:09:08,041 --> 00:09:09,041
Drop the act.

94
00:09:09,541 --> 00:09:10,781
I'd be better off asking a dog.

95
00:09:15,916 --> 00:09:16,958
What is it now?

96
00:09:17,583 --> 00:09:18,663
I need to use the bathroom.

97
00:09:19,833 --> 00:09:20,833
Go right here.

98
00:09:21,000 --> 00:09:21,791
I really need to go.

99
00:09:21,791 --> 00:09:22,791
Hurry up and untie me.

100
00:09:28,125 --> 00:09:29,125
I'll help you.

101
00:09:32,416 --> 00:09:34,000
If you don't want to go, keep walking.

102
00:09:37,041 --> 00:09:38,041
Fine, I'll go.

103
00:10:10,958 --> 00:10:12,518
Are you going to stand there and watch?

104
00:10:13,916 --> 00:10:14,916
Sure.

105
00:10:33,666 --> 00:10:34,750
Turns out you're a pervert.

106
00:10:35,958 --> 00:10:36,583
We're both men.

107
00:10:36,584 --> 00:10:37,666
What's the big deal?

108
00:10:39,083 --> 00:10:40,833
Then drop your pants and let me look.

109
00:10:51,958 --> 00:10:52,875
Okay, okay, okay.

110
00:10:52,876 --> 00:10:54,208
You win, you win, you win.

111
00:11:16,333 --> 00:11:17,583
Why did you suddenly stop?

112
00:11:18,166 --> 00:11:19,166
It's time to eat.

113
00:11:24,958 --> 00:11:26,798
I'd rather starve to
death than eat your food.

114
00:11:51,208 --> 00:11:52,208
What are you doing?

115
00:11:53,416 --> 00:11:54,749
You're just going to eat whatever you find?

116
00:11:54,750 --> 00:11:55,750
What if it's poisonous?

117
00:12:03,875 --> 00:12:05,315
You're the one who'll suffer anyway.

118
00:12:05,791 --> 00:12:07,431
Suit yourself if you want to mess around.

119
00:12:10,208 --> 00:12:11,648
I won't starve to death without you.

120
00:12:22,041 --> 00:12:23,041
What now?

121
00:12:27,416 --> 00:12:28,416
Lin Zai.

122
00:12:28,916 --> 00:12:30,000
What's wrong?

123
00:12:33,708 --> 00:12:34,708
An allergic reaction.

124
00:13:16,166 --> 00:13:17,166
I'm sorry.

125
00:13:18,500 --> 00:13:19,500
Don't go.

126
00:13:40,875 --> 00:13:41,500
Lin Zai!

127
00:13:41,875 --> 00:13:42,875
Lin Zai!

128
00:13:43,416 --> 00:13:44,166
Hang in there.

129
00:13:44,167 --> 00:13:45,416
I'll get you some medicine.

130
00:17:11,208 --> 00:17:11,708
Lin Zai!

131
00:17:12,125 --> 00:17:13,125
Lin Zai!

132
00:17:13,416 --> 00:17:14,416
Lin Zai!

133
00:18:27,208 --> 00:18:28,166
Lin Zai!

134
00:18:28,166 --> 00:18:29,166
You have to hold on!
